{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ribbit Ranch is a cozy idle game where you unwind while you collect and care for frogs. Raise these frogs and sell for them for a profit or keep them around to use in mini-games, breeding and to passively generate money!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754430/extras/3aab0e91f7ada4dfe6f7f2cb727fe9f2.avif?t=1759897213\" width=580 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open packs to get rare frog combinations! Be on the lookout for ultra-rare golden frogs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754430/extras/7af211f833d7cc8c6ddab90e3a838fa0.poster.avif?t=1759897213\" width=600 height=241 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754430/extras/7af211f833d7cc8c6ddab90e3a838fa0.webm?t=1759897213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754430/extras/83f9e0384dff57301838a0589da8b146.avif?t=1759897213\" width=580 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise your frogs by feeding them, and decide to keep them or sell them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754430/extras/08b082ffee15a8026ddb08c319ef516d.poster.avif?t=1759897213\" width=600 height=241 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754430/extras/08b082ffee15a8026ddb08c319ef516d.webm?t=1759897213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754430/extras/020809f95d59de106840231b174a5aeb.avif?t=1759897213\" width=580 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new frogs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754430/extras/7bccdd7f2e7514cd11b9dbc7615e81cb.poster.avif?t=1759897213\" width=600 height=241 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754430/extras/7bccdd7f2e7514cd11b9dbc7615e81cb.webm?t=1759897213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A big thank you for supporting my first Steam title! As a solo developer I truly appreciate everyone who has supported the game. Please consider Wishlisting this game if you are even just a little bit interested!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754430/extras/b8062b31fcafd691e3392486f81ff824.avif?t=1759897213\" width=1430 height=420 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3754430?t=1759897213","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3754430?t=1759897213","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754430/4e2c89b2aa3088c9ad218cf5871332a203ed2e76/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759897213","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754430/4e2c89b2aa3088c9ad218cf5871332a203ed2e76/capsule_184x69.jp